@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<div class="min-h-screen xl:px-32">
    <div class="container mx-auto py-20">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 shadow-xl">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8">Welcome to AgriConnect</h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-center mb-8">Connecting Agriculture with Green Energy Solutions</p>

            <!-- Section 1: Introduction -->
            <section class="mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Introduction</h2>
                <p>
                    In response to the growing need for sustainable agricultural practices and the integration of green energy solutions in South Africa, a visionary initiative named “Agri-Energy Connect” has been conceptualized.
                </p>
                <!-- Add more filler text here -->
            </section>

            <!-- Section 2: Key Features -->
            <!-- Section 2: Key Features -->
            <section class="mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">Key Features of the Platform</h2>

                <!-- Feature 1: Sustainable Farming Hub -->
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">1. Sustainable Farming Hub</h3>
                    <p>
                        The Sustainable Farming Hub is at the core of AgriConnect, serving as a digital space where farmers can showcase their produce and sustainable farming practices. Through user-friendly interfaces, farmers can create profiles and upload information about their farms, including crop varieties, cultivation methods, and harvesting techniques.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        The hub enables farmers to connect with a wider audience, including consumers, retailers, and fellow farmers. Visitors to the platform can explore various farms and their produce, fostering transparency and trust in the agricultural supply chain.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Additionally, the Sustainable Farming Hub facilitates knowledge exchange and collaboration among farmers. It features discussion forums, where farmers can share insights, ask questions, and seek advice from peers, thereby promoting continuous learning and innovation in sustainable agriculture.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Feature 2: Green Energy Marketplace -->
                <div class="mb-8">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">2. Green Energy Marketplace</h3>
                    <p>
                        The Green Energy Marketplace is a dedicated section of AgriConnect where users can explore and acquire green energy solutions tailored to agricultural needs. From solar-powered irrigation systems to wind turbines and biogas energy solutions, the marketplace offers a comprehensive range of products and services aimed at enhancing energy efficiency and sustainability on farms.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Users can browse through product listings, compare features and prices, and connect with reputable green tech providers. The marketplace fosters informed decision-making, empowering farmers to invest in renewable energy technologies that align with their operational requirements and environmental goals.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Feature 3: Educational Resources Via Blogs -->
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">3. Educational Resources Via Blogs</h3>
                    <p>
                        In addition to serving as a platform for commerce and collaboration, AgriConnect offers a rich repository of educational resources through its blog functionality. The blog section hosts a diverse range of articles, tutorials, and case studies focused on sustainable agriculture, renewable energy, and related topics.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        These blog posts are authored by experts in the field and cover various aspects of modern farming practices, green energy technologies, and environmental stewardship. Users can explore topics of interest, gain valuable insights, and stay updated on the latest trends and developments in the agricultural and energy sectors.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Moreover, the blog platform encourages user engagement through comments and discussions, fostering a community of learning and knowledge sharing among farmers, industry professionals, and enthusiasts. Whether it's learning about organic farming methods or discovering innovative energy solutions, the educational resources available on AgriConnect empower users to make informed decisions and drive positive change in their agricultural practices.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>
